{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-57188","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65609","text":"SpecPrompt Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57190","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65610","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompts are transient. Specs persist."}]}],"id":"blk-57189","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65611","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-65612","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-65613","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-65614","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-65615","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-65616","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-65617","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-57191","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-57193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65618","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-65619","marks":["bold"],"text":"SpecPrompt"},{"id":"spn-65620","text":" — an open standard and toolchain for spec-driven AI development. SpecPrompt defines a Markdown-based specification format (SPEC.md) that is both human-readable and machine-parseable, serving as the source of truth for agent behavior."}]},{"id":"blk-57194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65621","text":"SpecPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-65622","marks":["bold"],"text":"standards layer"},{"id":"spn-65623","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem — the format that bridges agent definition with execution, testing, and deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-57195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65624","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57196","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65625","text":"Why SpecPrompt?"}]},{"id":"blk-57197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65626","text":"Spec-Driven Development (SDD) has emerged as the industry consensus for AI-assisted development in 2026. GitHub Spec Kit, AWS Kiro, Cursor rules, and Next Moca ADL all use different specification formats. Teams switching tools lose context."}]},{"id":"blk-57198","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65627","text":"SpecPrompt defines the interoperable standard — a Markdown-native format that is:"}]},{"id":"blk-57199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65628","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-65629","marks":["bold"],"text":"Markdown-native"},{"id":"spn-65630","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-65631","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-65632","text":" files, no proprietary format 2. "},{"id":"spn-65633","marks":["bold"],"text":"Human-first"},{"id":"spn-65634","text":" — readable by any team member, parseable by any agent 3. "},{"id":"spn-65635","marks":["bold"],"text":"Versioned"},{"id":"spn-65636","text":" — lives in git. Branching, diffing, merging. 4. "},{"id":"spn-65637","marks":["bold"],"text":"Testable"},{"id":"spn-65638","text":" — acceptance criteria are machine-executable 5. "},{"id":"spn-65639","marks":["bold"],"text":"Composable"},{"id":"spn-65640","text":" — specs reference other specs 6. "},{"id":"spn-65641","marks":["bold"],"text":"Tool-agnostic"},{"id":"spn-65642","text":" — works with any SDD-compatible tool"}]},{"id":"blk-57200","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65643","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57201","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65644","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-57202","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-57203","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-57204","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: SpecPrompt Docs\n\nspec/README"},{"id":"blk-57205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65645","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57206","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65646","text":"The SPEC.md Format"}]},{"id":"blk-57207","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65647","text":"Every spec follows a structured Markdown format with YAML frontmatter:"}]},{"id":"blk-57208","kind":"code","language":"markdown","text":"---\nname: agent-name\nversion: 1.0.0\nruntime: opensentience | any\nauthor: team-or-person\ncreated: 2026-01-15\nupdated: 2026-02-22\ntags: [category, domain]\ndependencies:\n  - graphonomous\n---\n\n## Purpose\nWhat this agent does and why.\n\n## Capabilities\n- capability:scope (description)\n\n## Constraints\n- Hard and soft behavioral boundaries\n\n## Acceptance Tests\n- Given [precondition] -> [expected behavior]"},{"id":"blk-57209","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65648","marks":["bold"],"text":"Required sections:"},{"id":"spn-65649","text":" Purpose, Capabilities, Constraints, Acceptance Tests."}]},{"id":"blk-57210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65650","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57211","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65651","text":"Toolchain"}]},{"id":"blk-57212","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65652","text":"CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-57213","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"specprompt validate SPEC.md      # Validate against format standard\nspecprompt lint SPEC.md          # Check for best practices\nspecprompt test-gen SPEC.md      # Generate test scaffolding\nspecprompt diff SPEC.md@v1 SPEC.md@v2  # Diff two versions\nspecprompt publish SPEC.md       # Publish to FleetPrompt registry"},{"id":"blk-57214","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65653","text":"MCP Tools"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-57216","spans":[{"id":"spn-65654","text":"Tool"}]},{"id":"blk-57217","spans":[{"id":"spn-65655","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-57215","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-57218","spans":[{"id":"spn-65656","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_validate"}]},{"id":"blk-57219","spans":[{"id":"spn-65657","text":"Validate against format standard"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57220","spans":[{"id":"spn-65658","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_lint"}]},{"id":"blk-57221","spans":[{"id":"spn-65659","text":"Check for best practices"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57222","spans":[{"id":"spn-65660","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_generate"}]},{"id":"blk-57223","spans":[{"id":"spn-65661","text":"Generate from natural language"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57224","spans":[{"id":"spn-65662","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_test_gen"}]},{"id":"blk-57225","spans":[{"id":"spn-65663","text":"Generate test cases from acceptance criteria"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57226","spans":[{"id":"spn-65664","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_diff"}]},{"id":"blk-57227","spans":[{"id":"spn-65665","text":"Compare two spec versions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57228","spans":[{"id":"spn-65666","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_search"}]},{"id":"blk-57229","spans":[{"id":"spn-65667","text":"Search FleetPrompt registry"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-57230","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65668","text":"Reference Parsers"}]},{"id":"blk-57231","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65669","text":"Available in "},{"id":"spn-65670","marks":["bold"],"text":"Elixir"},{"id":"spn-65671","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-65672","marks":["bold"],"text":"TypeScript"},{"id":"spn-65673","text":". Formal PEG grammar included in the specification for building conformant parsers."}]},{"id":"blk-57232","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65674","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57233","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65675","text":"Ecosystem Integration"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-57235","spans":[{"id":"spn-65676","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-57236","spans":[{"id":"spn-65677","text":"How It Uses SpecPrompt"}]}],"id":"blk-57234","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-57237","spans":[{"id":"spn-65678","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"}]},{"id":"blk-57238","spans":[{"id":"spn-65679","text":"Specs are the primary input to the build pipeline"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57239","spans":[{"id":"spn-65680","marks":["bold"],"text":"OpenSentience"}]},{"id":"blk-57240","spans":[{"id":"spn-65681","text":"Agent manifests reference SPEC.md for permission derivation"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57241","spans":[{"id":"spn-65682","marks":["bold"],"text":"Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-57242","spans":[{"id":"spn-65683","text":"Learning happens within spec-defined boundaries"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57243","spans":[{"id":"spn-65684","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-57244","spans":[{"id":"spn-65685","text":"Specs are published as discoverable templates"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57245","spans":[{"id":"spn-65686","marks":["bold"],"text":"Delegatic"}]},{"id":"blk-57246","spans":[{"id":"spn-65687","text":"Multi-agent orchestration specs define agent roles"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-57247","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65688","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57248","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65689","text":"Interoperability"}]},{"id":"blk-57249","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57251","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65690","marks":["bold"],"text":"AGENTS.md"},{"id":"spn-65691","text":" — complementary (codebase conventions vs. agent behavior specs)"}]}],"id":"blk-57250","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57253","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65692","marks":["bold"],"text":"Next Moca ADL"},{"id":"spn-65693","text":" — bidirectional import/export"}]}],"id":"blk-57252","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57255","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65694","marks":["bold"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-65695","text":" — bidirectional mapping (capabilities, constraints, governance)"}]}],"id":"blk-57254","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-57256","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65696","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57257","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65697","text":"Project Links"}]},{"id":"blk-57258","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57260","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65698","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec:"},{"id":"spn-65699","text":" "},{"id":"spn-65700","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/specprompt.com/docs/spec/README.md"}],"text":"Product Specification"}]}],"id":"blk-57259","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57262","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65701","marks":["bold"],"text":"User stories:"},{"id":"spn-65702","text":" "},{"id":"spn-65703","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/specprompt.com/docs/ux/user-stories.md"}],"text":"SpecPrompt User Stories"}]}],"id":"blk-57261","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57264","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65704","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build prompt:"},{"id":"spn-65705","text":" "},{"id":"spn-65706","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/specprompt.com/prompts/BUILD.md"}],"text":"SpecPrompt Implementation Build Prompt"}]}],"id":"blk-57263","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57266","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65707","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&] Protocol ecosystem:"},{"id":"spn-65708","text":" "},{"id":"spn-65709","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/"}]}],"id":"blk-57265","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-57267","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65710","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57268","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65711","text":"*[&] Ampersand Box Design — specprompt.com*"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraq756fwgfjcagc6jmrurbacol25rsdqyqatmrcvjd2dtut46225da","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}